# FitDaily metrics dashboard — server-side secrets. Copy to dashboard/.env
# (dashboard/.env is gitignored — never commit it).
#
# The service_role key bypasses Row-Level Security so it can read aggregate
# counts across ALL users. It must ONLY ever live here on the server. The
# browser dashboard receives computed numbers, never this key.

# Supabase URL is auto-read from the project root .env (EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL)
# if present, so you usually don't need to set it here. Uncomment to override:
# SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co

# REQUIRED. Supabase → Project Settings → API → Project API keys → service_role
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Optional: port for the local dashboard (default 4310)
# DASHBOARD_PORT=4310

# -------- Optional: live RevenueCat revenue $ figures --------------------------
# Without these, subscription metrics are derived from profiles.entitlement
# (kept in sync by your revenuecat-webhook). Add both to also show revenue/MRR.
# RevenueCat → Project settings → API keys → Secret API key (v2, starts sk_)
# REVENUECAT_SECRET_KEY=
# REVENUECAT_PROJECT_ID=
